        "raw": "Which makes the ebay price jacking even more contemptible.\n\nWhat I wonder most about isn't the old promos like RC Wraith, it's the ones that postdate the release of the two variant collections, such as hero Infinitor and Omnitron-U.  I know that Adam made an art for the \"normal\" versions of these, but I have no idea if they were ever even printed, let alone distributed.  The first time I saw them announce OU, it was with the art that his* promo version uses, where he's standing in the kind of hunched position and looking right; the only time I've ever seen the art with him staying straight and turning his head was in the video game.\n\n* I know that O-X prefers the pronoun \"it\", but using this is a recipe for unintelligible sentences at the best of times, and we're discussing a piece of card art here, so referring to the picture as \"it\" and the character as \"him\" makes for better clarity.",
