        "created_at": "2021-09-16T20:12:34.341Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Each new variant introduced in the OblivAeon KS has a version backers received and a version in the collectors edition.</p>\n<p>This is the KS version<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b1f931837957bfd60e4bb5843d26c4c646ed7f3c.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b1f931837957bfd60e4bb5843d26c4c646ed7f3c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1f931837957bfd60e4bb5843d26c4c646ed7f3c_2_355x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"poqpdknFHkcMdJbwPc7rr8CuSny\" width=\"355\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1f931837957bfd60e4bb5843d26c4c646ed7f3c_2_355x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b1f931837957bfd60e4bb5843d26c4c646ed7f3c.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b1f931837957bfd60e4bb5843d26c4c646ed7f3c.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1f931837957bfd60e4bb5843d26c4c646ed7f3c_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">427×600 87.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is the variant and foil collection version<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8e0bc6401fe78763bc675a7fa34508a5963c3706.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/8e0bc6401fe78763bc675a7fa34508a5963c3706\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greatertha